              "text": "Yes, but be aware of the practical limits of browser memory. A 500-page PDF at 300 DPI could produce 500 large images and take several minutes. For very large documents, convert in batches — pages 1-50, then 51-100, and so on. Using 150 DPI instead of 300 cuts the total time and memory use by 75%."
